---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping & Delivery Policy" description="Cybex Precision Gunworx shipping and delivery policy. Free shipping on orders over $500. FFL requirements for firearms shipments.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Shipping Policy</span></div>
      <h1>Shipping & Delivery</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Shipping Methods</h2>
        <p>Most orders ship within 1-3 business days via insured carrier (UPS or FedEx). Custom builds may require additional time — we'll keep you updated on your build timeline.</p>

        <h2>Free Shipping</h2>
        <p>Orders over $500 qualify for free standard shipping within the continental United States.</p>

        <h2>Firearms Shipping (FFL Required)</h2>
        <p>All complete firearms and serialized lower receivers <strong>ship only to a licensed Federal Firearms Licensee (FFL)</strong> – never to a residence. This is required by federal law.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>At checkout, provide your FFL dealer's contact details, or choose Cybex Precision Gunworx as your receiving FFL ($25 transfer fee applies).</li>
          <li>Your FFL must email us a current, signed copy of their license <strong>before</strong> we ship. Orders without a verified FFL are held, and may be cancelled and refunded.</li>
          <li>Firearms ship via carrier with adult signature required (21+ for handguns). They are released to you only after you complete ATF Form 4473 and pass a background check at the FFL.</li>
          <li>Shipping to a P.O. Box is not available for any item.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Restricted Destinations</h2>
        <p>We do not ship firearms, receivers or uppers to certain states and territories (including California and New York). See the <a href="/policies/restricted-states/">full restricted-states list</a>. Orders to these locations will be cancelled and refunded.</p>

        <h2>Non-Firearm Items</h2>
        <p>Non-serialized accessories, optics, and apparel ship directly to your door, subject to your state's laws. Stripped uppers and regulated parts (such as magazines) may be restricted where you live – you are responsible for confirming legality. Adult signature may be required.</p>

        <h2>Shipping Rates</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Standard Shipping: $9.99 (3-7 business days)</li>
          <li>Expedited Shipping: $19.99 (2-3 business days)</li>
          <li>Free Shipping: Orders over $500</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Order Tracking</h2>
        <p>Tracking information is emailed once your order ships. If you haven't received tracking within 3 business days, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
